{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス終わったねー！\nみなさん今年のクリスマスは\nどんな思い出ができましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/happy02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントに来てくださったかた\n恋人や友人と過ごしたかた\n家族と過ごしたかた\nそれぞれ心に残るクリスマスを\n過ごせたでしょうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/fullmoon.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさはというと\n自分へのご褒美で\nハーゲンダッツのアイスを\nプレゼントしました！へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんから頂いた気持ちと\nお手紙、プレゼントは\nみさの一生の宝物"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！\n本当にいつも言ってるけど\nありがとうございます！\nお手紙はひとつひとつ\n大事に読み返します。\n頂いた物は\n大切に使わせてもらってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんから頂くだけでなくて\nみさの方から元気や愛を\nたっくさん届けられるように\n素敵な人間になれるように\n活躍できるよーに！\n2012年、頑張る(´･ω･｀)！\nはやくも来年の抱負〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ、もっと頑張るけん\n見守っててください！！\nお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁクリスマスが終わったら\nイルミネーションが\n一気に減ってさみしいよ〜。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに街中が\nキラキラしてたのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも我が家は、毎年\nあけましておめでとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になってもまだリビングに\nツリーさんが居ました〜。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも誰も直さない！\nそしてみさの誕生日まで\nツリーさん健在です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもそんなことない？笑\nさすがにないか(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスあるある\n募集しますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/happy02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はどうやろな〜？\nママに聞こ(=゜ω゜)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと直すよーに言おう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ明日は朝早いので\nみさみさどろんします。\nおやすみなさい〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/26/img_1220.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんとのツーショット。\nまだまだ載せてないメンバー\nたくさんいるから\nいっぱい載せてくよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}